	(descr "Viking LR12 (2512) ultra-low-ohm metal strip current sense resistor, 2-wire land pattern with Kelvin sense vias in the pads, for the Device:R_Shunt symbol: current pads 1 / 4 (2.7 x 3.6 mm, 2.95 mm apart, datasheet 2-wire layout), sense pads 2 / 3 = 0.3/0.6 mm vias at x -/+1.875 (inner end of the 1.30 mm terminal), tented on B.Cu, to be filled and capped. Net-tie groups 1-2 and 3-4. Source: Viking LR series datasheet REV.D2 2022-02-15: LR12 0M50 body L 6.35+/-0.254 W 3.18+/-0.254 T 1.25 terminal D 1.30+/-0.38 mm (p.2), 2-wire pad layout (p.5). F.Cu keepout between terminals (datasheet: no circuits between pads). 3D: KiCad generic R_2512_6332Metric. YESC: LR12FTDR0M50, 0.5 mOhm 1% +/-50ppm 3W@70C, LCSC C37635712.")
